{"id":"7c60f8381488af43","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-supernilpotent.md","title":"Supernilpotent","display":"df-supernilpotent — Supernilpotent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-supernilpotent","aliases":["93-df-supernilpotent"],"display":"df-supernilpotent — Supernilpotent","depends_on":["[[93-df-commutator]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-polynomial]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-supernilpotent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-supernilpotent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supernilpotent — Supernilpotent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f40774d4e625146e\" href=\"?note=f40774d4e625146e\" title=\"93-df-polynomial\">93-df-polynomial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate, with diagonal and universal congruences <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> whenever it is an algebra.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>, and the type-indexed predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f40774d4e625146e\" href=\"?note=f40774d4e625146e\" title=\"93-df-polynomial\">93-df-polynomial</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Block}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Block}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Offset}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Offset}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CubeArg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CubeArg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}\\)</span>, higher centralization <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cen}^{k+1}_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cen}^{k+1}_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SN}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SN}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\mathbf A,k)\">\\(\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\mathbf A,k)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\theta:(k+1)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\theta:(k+1)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>；重复全同余族在相同代数和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 上定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>辅助函数的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf m:(k+1)\\to\\omega\">\\(\\mathbf m:(k+1)\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon:(k+1)\\to2\">\\(\\varepsilon:(k+1)\\to2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k+1\">\\(i&lt;k+1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a,\\bar b:(k+1)\\to V\">\\(\\bar a,\\bar b:(k+1)\\to V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a(i),\\bar b(i)\\in|\\mathbf A|^{\\mathbf m(i)}\">\\(\\bar a(i),\\bar b(i)\\in|\\mathbf A|^{\\mathbf m(i)}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:|\\mathbf A|^{\\sum_{i&lt;k+1}\\mathbf m(i)}\\to|\\mathbf A|\">\\(p:|\\mathbf A|^{\\sum_{i&lt;k+1}\\mathbf m(i)}\\to|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Block}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Block}_{93}\\)</span> 只需其中涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon\">\\(i,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon\\)</span> 的条件，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Offset}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Offset}_{93}\\)</span> 只需涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf m,i\">\\(\\mathbf m,i\\)</span> 的条件。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Block}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon,i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\bar a(i),&amp;\\varepsilon(i)=0,\\\\\n\\bar b(i),&amp;\\varepsilon(i)=1,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Block}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon,i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\bar a(i),&amp;\\varepsilon(i)=0,\\\\\n\\bar b(i),&amp;\\varepsilon(i)=1,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Offset}_{93}(\\mathbf m,i)\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{h&lt;i}\\mathbf m(h)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Offset}_{93}(\\mathbf m,i)\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{h&lt;i}\\mathbf m(h)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CubeArg}_{93}(\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon;k)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{Offset}_{93}(\\mathbf m,i)+j,\n\\operatorname{Block}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon,i)(j)\n\\right\\rangle:i&lt;k+1\\land j&lt;\\mathbf m(i)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CubeArg}_{93}(\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon;k)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{Offset}_{93}(\\mathbf m,i)+j,\n\\operatorname{Block}_{93}(\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon,i)(j)\n\\right\\rangle:i&lt;k+1\\land j&lt;\\mathbf m(i)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon;k)\\coloneqq\np\\bigl(\\operatorname{CubeArg}_{93}(\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon;k)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon;k)\\coloneqq\np\\bigl(\\operatorname{CubeArg}_{93}(\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\varepsilon;k)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,1\\rangle:i&lt;k\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,1\\rangle:i&lt;k\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cen}^{k+1}_{\\mathbf A}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\omega\\land\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\boldsymbol\\theta:k+1\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf m\\in\\omega^{k+1}\\;\\forall p\\;\\forall\\bar a\\;\\forall\\bar b\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}\\left(p,\\mathbf A,\n\\sum_{i&lt;k+1}\\mathbf m(i);\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bar a:k+1\\to V\\land\\bar b:k+1\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;k+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bar a(i),\\bar b(i)\\in|\\mathbf A|^{\\mathbf m(i)}\n\\land\\forall j&lt;\\mathbf m(i)\\;\n\\langle\\bar a(i)(j),\\bar b(i)(j)\\rangle\\in\\boldsymbol\\theta(i)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\Bigl[\n\\Bigl(\\forall\\eta\\in2^k\\setminus\\{\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}(k)\\}\\;\n\\Bigl\\langle\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\eta^\\frown\\langle0\\rangle;k),\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\eta^\\frown\\langle1\\rangle;k)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\\in\\delta\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\to\\Bigl\\langle\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\n\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}(k)^\\frown\\langle0\\rangle;k),\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\n\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}(k)^\\frown\\langle1\\rangle;k)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\\in\\delta\\Bigr]\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cen}^{k+1}_{\\mathbf A}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\omega\\land\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\boldsymbol\\theta:k+1\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf m\\in\\omega^{k+1}\\;\\forall p\\;\\forall\\bar a\\;\\forall\\bar b\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}\\left(p,\\mathbf A,\n\\sum_{i&lt;k+1}\\mathbf m(i);\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bar a:k+1\\to V\\land\\bar b:k+1\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;k+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bar a(i),\\bar b(i)\\in|\\mathbf A|^{\\mathbf m(i)}\n\\land\\forall j&lt;\\mathbf m(i)\\;\n\\langle\\bar a(i)(j),\\bar b(i)(j)\\rangle\\in\\boldsymbol\\theta(i)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\Bigl[\n\\Bigl(\\forall\\eta\\in2^k\\setminus\\{\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}(k)\\}\\;\n\\Bigl\\langle\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\eta^\\frown\\langle0\\rangle;k),\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\\eta^\\frown\\langle1\\rangle;k)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\\in\\delta\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\to\\Bigl\\langle\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\n\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}(k)^\\frown\\langle0\\rangle;k),\n\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}(p,\\mathbf m,\\bar a,\\bar b,\n\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}(k)^\\frown\\langle1\\rangle;k)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\\in\\delta\\Bigr]\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\mathbf A,k)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\n\\mathrm{Cen}^{k+1}_{\\mathbf A}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\delta)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\mathbf A,k)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\n\\mathrm{Cen}^{k+1}_{\\mathbf A}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\delta)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\rangle:i&lt;k+1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\rangle:i&lt;k+1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SN}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nk\\geq1\\land\n\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;k);\\mathbf A,k)\n=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supernilpotent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SN}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nk\\geq1\\land\n\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;k);\\mathbf A,k)\n=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\boldsymbol\\theta:(k+1)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\mathrm{Cen}^{k+1}_{\\mathbf A}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\nabla_{\\mathbf A})\n\\land\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\mathbf A,k)\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[k\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\boldsymbol\\theta:(k+1)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\mathrm{Cen}^{k+1}_{\\mathbf A}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\nabla_{\\mathbf A})\n\\land\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\mathbf A,k)\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The block selector and cube-argument graph expose the Boolean vertex choice and the ordered concatenation of all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k+1\">\\(k+1\\)</span> blocks. The dimension, arity family, tuple families, congruence family, all-ones vertex, and repeated universal-congruence family are explicit; the polynomial signature is recovered from the quantified algebra witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"f40774d4e625146e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]], and the type-indexed predicate $\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-polynomial]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"f40774d4e625146e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]], and the type-indexed predicate $\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-polynomial]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Block}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Offset}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CubeArg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cube}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OneTuple}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cen}^{k+1}_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SN}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\boldsymbol\\theta;\\mathbf A,k)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}